Subject: [PATCH 40/45] neurajl: cap the binding list in the compaction note
 and the lost-bindings notice

tin3's note listed 1,000+ bindings in 7.4k characters. Past 2,000 characters
the most recently set bindings are kept and the rest are counted, with a
pointer to varinfo(). Red control: the two capping tests fail uncapped.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
